<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="description" content="Alquila tu barredora profesional para limpieza urbana, industrial y municipal. Amplia flota de barredoras viales disponibles. Solicita presupuesto sin compromiso.">
<title>Alquila Tu Barredora | Alquiler de Barredoras Profesionales Viales e Industriales</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Lato:wght@300;400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root {
    --lima: #C2D12E;
    --lima-dark: #94A014;
    --dark: #252525;
    --gray: #969696;
    --white: #FFFFFF;
    --card-bg: #2e2e2e;
    --light-bg: #f7f7f7;
  }
  *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
  body { font-family: 'Lato', sans-serif; color: var(--dark); background: var(--white); }
  h1, h2, h3, h4, .btn, nav { font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; }

  /* NAV */
  nav {
    position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 100;
    background: var(--dark);
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 0 5%;
    height: 64px;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.4);
  }
  .nav-logo { color: var(--white); font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; }
  .nav-logo span { color: var(--lima); }
  .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 28px; list-style: none; }
  .nav-links a { color: var(--gray); text-decoration: none; font-size: .875rem; font-weight: 500; transition: color .2s; }
  .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--lima); }
  .nav-cta { background: var(--lima); color: var(--dark); padding: 8px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: .875rem; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; transition: background .2s; }
  .nav-cta:hover { background: var(--lima-dark); color: var(--white); }
  .hamburger { display: none; flex-direction: column; gap: 5px; cursor: pointer; }
  .hamburger span { width: 24px; height: 2px; background: var(--white); border-radius: 2px; transition: .3s; }

  /* HERO */
  #hero {
    background: var(--dark);
    padding: 80px 5% 70px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 48px;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 88vh;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  #hero::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute; inset: 0;
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 70% 50%, rgba(194,209,46,.08) 0%, transparent 70%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .hero-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    background: rgba(194,209,46,.15);
    border: 1px solid var(--lima);
    color: var(--lima);
    font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
    font-size: .75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: .08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 5px 14px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 22px;
  }
  .hero-title {
    color: var(--white);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.2rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.15;
    margin-bottom: 22px;
  }
  .hero-title span { color: var(--lima); }
  .hero-subtitle {
    color: var(--gray);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 36px;
    max-width: 520px;
  }
  .hero-actions { display: flex; gap: 14px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .btn-primary {
    background: var(--lima); color: var(--dark);
    padding: 14px 28px; border-radius: 8px;
    font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: .95rem;
    text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
    transition: background .2s, transform .15s;
    border: none; cursor: pointer;
  }
  .btn-primary:hover { background: var(--lima-dark); color: var(--white); transform: translateY(-1px); }
  .btn-outline {
    background: transparent; color: var(--white);
    padding: 13px 28px; border-radius: 8px;
    font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: .95rem;
    text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
    border: 1.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,.25);
    transition: border-color .2s, color .2s, transform .15s;
  }
  .btn-outline:hover { border-color: var(--lima); color: var(--lima); transform: translateY(-1px); }
  .hero-visual {
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    position: relative;
  }
  .hero-image-box {
    width: 100%; max-width: 520px;
    aspect-ratio: 16/10;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #333 0%, #1a1a1a 100%);
    border-radius: 16px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(194,209,46,.2);
    overflow: hidden;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    position: relative;
  }
  .hero-image-box img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }
  .hero-image-placeholder {
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 12px;
    color: var(--gray); font-size: .85rem;
  }
  .hero-image-placeholder svg { opacity: .4; }
  .hero-stats {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3,1fr);
    gap: 2px; margin-top: 48px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08); padding-top: 32px;
  }
  .hero-stat { text-align: center; }
  .hero-stat-value { color: var(--lima); font-family: 'Poppins',sans-serif; font-size: 1.8rem; font-weight: 800; }
  .hero-stat-label { color: var(--gray); font-size: .78rem; margin-top: 2px; }

  /* SECTION COMMONS */
  section { padding: 80px 5%; }
  .section-label {
    display: inline-block;
    color: var(--lima-dark); font-family: 'Poppins',sans-serif;
    font-size: .72rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .1em;
    text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .section-title { font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 2.2rem); font-weight: 700; color: var(--dark); line-height: 1.25; margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .section-title.light { color: var(--white); }
  .section-subtitle { color: var(--gray); font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.7; max-width: 600px; }
  .section-header { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 52px; }
  .separator { width: 48px; height: 4px; background: var(--lima); border-radius: 2px; margin: 16px auto 0; }
  .separator.left { margin-left: 0; }

  /* VENTAJAS */
  #ventajas { background: var(--light-bg); }
  .ventajas-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
    gap: 24px;
  }
  .ventaja-card {
    background: var(--white);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 32px 24px;
    border-bottom: 3px solid transparent;
    transition: border-color .25s, box-shadow .25s, transform .2s;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.06);
  }
  .ventaja-card:hover { border-color: var(--lima); box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.1); transform: translateY(-3px); }
  .ventaja-icon {
    width: 52px; height: 52px;
    background: rgba(194,209,46,.12);
    border-radius: 12px;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }
  .ventaja-icon svg { color: var(--lima-dark); }
  .ventaja-card h3 { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px; color: var(--dark); }
  .ventaja-card p { font-size: .875rem; color: var(--gray); line-height: 1.6; }

  /* CATALOGO */
  #catalogo { background: var(--dark); }
  #catalogo .section-title { color: var(--white); }
  #catalogo .section-subtitle { color: var(--gray); }
  .catalogo-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(300px, 1fr));
    gap: 24px;
  }
  .maquina-card {
    background: var(--card-bg);
    border-radius: 14px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.06);
    transition: transform .25s, border-color .25s, box-shadow .25s;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column;
  }
  .maquina-card:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); border-color: rgba(194,209,46,.35); box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(0,0,0,.35); }
  .maquina-img {
    width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 16/9;
    background: #1e1e1e;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    overflow: hidden; position: relative;
  }
  .maquina-img img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; transition: transform .3s; }
  .maquina-card:hover .maquina-img img { transform: scale(1.04); }
  .maquina-img-placeholder {
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
    color: #555; font-size: .8rem;
  }
  .maquina-type-badge {
    position: absolute; top: 12px; left: 12px;
    background: var(--lima); color: var(--dark);
    font-family: 'Poppins',sans-serif; font-size: .68rem; font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: .06em; text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 4px;
  }
  .maquina-body { padding: 22px; flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
  .maquina-name { color: var(--white); font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .maquina-desc { color: var(--gray); font-size: .83rem; line-height: 1.65; margin-bottom: 18px; flex: 1;
    display: -webkit-box; -webkit-line-clamp: 4; -webkit-box-orient: vertical; overflow: hidden; }
  .maquina-actions { display: flex; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .btn-card-primary {
    flex: 1; min-width: 130px;
    background: var(--lima); color: var(--dark);
    padding: 10px 16px; border-radius: 7px;
    font-family: 'Poppins',sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: .8rem;
    text-decoration: none; text-align: center;
    transition: background .2s;
    border: none; cursor: pointer; display: inline-block;
  }
  .btn-card-primary:hover { background: var(--lima-dark); color: var(--white); }
  .btn-card-secondary {
    flex: 1; min-width: 130px;
    background: transparent; color: var(--gray);
    padding: 9px 16px; border-radius: 7px;
    font-family: 'Poppins',sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: .8rem;
    text-decoration: none; text-align: center;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15);
    transition: border-color .2s, color .2s;
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 5px;
  }
  .btn-card-secondary:hover { border-color: var(--lima); color: var(--lima); }

  /* PRESUPUESTO */
  #presupuesto {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--lima-dark) 0%, var(--lima) 100%);
    text-align: center;
    padding: 80px 5%;
  }
  #presupuesto h2 { color: var(--dark); font-size: clamp(1.8rem,3.5vw,2.4rem); font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 18px; }
  #presupuesto p { color: rgba(37,37,37,.75); font-size: 1.05rem; max-width: 640px; margin: 0 auto 36px; line-height: 1.7; }
  .btn-dark {
    background: var(--dark); color: var(--white);
    padding: 15px 36px; border-radius: 8px;
    font-family: 'Poppins',sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 1rem;
    text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
    transition: background .2s, transform .15s;
  }
  .btn-dark:hover { background: #111; transform: translateY(-2px); }

  /* SEO */
  #donde { background: var(--white); }
  .donde-layout { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 60px; align-items: center; }
  .donde-text h2 { font-size: clamp(1.6rem,2.8vw,2rem); font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 18px; }
  .donde-text p { color: #555; font-size: .95rem; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .donde-features { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; margin-top: 28px; }
  .donde-feature { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px; }
  .donde-feature-icon {
    width: 32px; height: 32px; flex-shrink: 0;
    background: rgba(194,209,46,.15); border-radius: 8px;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  }
  .donde-feature-text { font-size: .88rem; color: #555; line-height: 1.55; padding-top: 5px; }
  .donde-visual {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 16px;
  }
  .donde-tag {
    background: var(--dark); color: var(--white);
    border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px 20px;
    font-family: 'Poppins',sans-serif;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px;
  }
  .donde-tag:nth-child(2) { background: var(--lima); color: var(--dark); margin-top: 24px; }
  .donde-tag:nth-child(3) { background: var(--lima-dark); color: var(--white); margin-top: -24px; }
  .donde-tag:nth-child(4) { background: #f0f0f0; color: var(--dark); }
  .donde-tag-title { font-size: .8rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .05em; text-transform: uppercase; opacity: .7; }
  .donde-tag-value { font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; }

  /* SOPORTE */
  #soporte { background: var(--dark); }
  .soporte-inner {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 60px; align-items: center;
  }
  .soporte-text .section-label { color: var(--lima); }
  .soporte-text .section-title { color: var(--white); }
  .soporte-text p { color: var(--gray); font-size: .95rem; line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 16px; }
  .soporte-items { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px; margin-top: 32px; }
  .soporte-item { display: flex; gap: 16px; align-items: flex-start; }
  .soporte-item-icon {
    width: 44px; height: 44px; flex-shrink: 0;
    background: rgba(194,209,46,.1); border-radius: 10px;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    border: 1px solid rgba(194,209,46,.2);
  }
  .soporte-item-text h4 { color: var(--white); font-size: .95rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .soporte-item-text p { color: var(--gray); font-size: .83rem; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0; }

  /* CONTACTO */
  #contacto { background: var(--light-bg); }
  .contacto-inner { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 60px; align-items: start; }
  .contacto-info .section-title { margin-bottom: 22px; }
  .contacto-channels { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px; margin-top: 28px; }
  .contacto-channel {
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px;
    background: var(--white); border-radius: 10px; padding: 16px 20px;
    text-decoration: none; color: var(--dark);
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.06);
    transition: box-shadow .2s, transform .2s;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--lima);
  }
  .contacto-channel:hover { box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.1); transform: translateX(3px); }
  .channel-icon {
    width: 44px; height: 44px; flex-shrink: 0;
    background: rgba(194,209,46,.12); border-radius: 10px;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  }
  .channel-label { font-size: .72rem; color: var(--gray); font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: .05em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .channel-value { font-family: 'Poppins',sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--dark); }
  .contacto-cta-box {
    background: var(--dark); border-radius: 16px; padding: 40px 36px;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px;
  }
  .contacto-cta-box h3 { color: var(--white); font-size: 1.4rem; font-weight: 700; }
  .contacto-cta-box p { color: var(--gray); font-size: .9rem; line-height: 1.7; }
  .btn-cta-full {
    background: var(--lima); color: var(--dark);
    padding: 15px 28px; border-radius: 8px;
    font-family: 'Poppins',sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 1rem;
    text-decoration: none; text-align: center;
    transition: background .2s, transform .15s;
    display: block;
  }
  .btn-cta-full:hover { background: var(--lima-dark); color: var(--white); transform: translateY(-2px); }

  /* FOOTER */
  footer {
    background: #1a1a1a; color: var(--gray);
    padding: 32px 5%;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
    flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px;
    font-size: .82rem;
  }
  footer a { color: var(--lima); text-decoration: none; }

  /* RESPONSIVE */
  @media (max-width: 960px) {
    #hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; text-align: center; min-height: auto; padding: 60px 5% 50px; }
    .hero-actions { justify-content: center; }
    .hero-subtitle { margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }
    .hero-visual { display: none; }
    .hero-stats { grid-template-columns: repeat(3,1fr); }
    .donde-layout, .soporte-inner, .contacto-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .donde-visual { display: none; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 680px) {
    .nav-links, .nav-cta-desktop { display: none; }
    .hamburger { display: flex; }
    .catalogo-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .hero-stats { grid-template-columns: repeat(3,1fr); }
    section { padding: 60px 5%; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- NAV -->
<nav>
  <a class="nav-logo" href="#"><span>Alquila</span>TuBarredora</a>
  <ul class="nav-links">
    <li><a href="#ventajas">Ventajas</a></li>
    <li><a href="#catalogo">Máquinas</a></li>
    <li><a href="#donde">Información</a></li>
    <li><a href="#soporte">Soporte</a></li>
    <li><a href="#contacto">Contacto</a></li>
  </ul>
  <a class="nav-cta nav-cta-desktop" href="#presupuesto">Solicitar presupuesto</a>
  <div class="hamburger" onclick="this.classList.toggle('open')">
    <span></span><span></span><span></span>
  </div>
</nav>

<!-- HERO -->
<section id="hero">
  <div class="hero-content">
    <span class="hero-badge">&#10003; Disponibilidad inmediata</span>
    <h1 class="hero-title">Alquila tu <span>barredora</span> profesional</h1>
    <p class="hero-subtitle">La solución más eficiente para la limpieza urbana, industrial y municipal. Disponemos de una amplia flota de barredoras profesionales para adaptarnos a cualquier necesidad de limpieza viaria, industrial o municipal.</p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a href="#presupuesto" class="btn-primary">
        <svg width="16" height="16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9 12h6M9 16h6M17 3H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v14a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2V5a2 2 0 00-2-2z"/></svg>
        Solicitar presupuesto
      </a>
      <a href="#catalogo" class="btn-outline">
        <svg width="16" height="16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 6h16M4 10h16M4 14h16M4 18h16"/></svg>
        Ver máquinas disponibles
      </a>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-stats">
      <div class="hero-stat"><div class="hero-stat-value">13+</div><div class="hero-stat-label">Modelos disponibles</div></div>
      <div class="hero-stat"><div class="hero-stat-value">24h</div><div class="hero-stat-label">Entrega rápida</div></div>
      <div class="hero-stat"><div class="hero-stat-value">100%</div><div class="hero-stat-label">Revisadas y listas</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-visual">
    <div class="hero-image-box">
      <img src="/img/hero-barredora.jpg" alt="Barredora profesional urbana" onerror="this.parentElement.innerHTML='<div class=\'hero-image-placeholder\'><svg width=\'64\' height=\'64\' fill=\'none\' stroke=\'currentColor\' stroke-width=\'1\' viewBox=\'0 0 24 24\'><rect x=\'2\' y=\'4\' width=\'20\' height=\'16\' rx=\'2\'/><circle cx=\'7\' cy=\'17\' r=\'2\'/><circle cx=\'17\' cy=\'17\' r=\'2\'/><path d=\'M2 10h20\'/></svg><span>Imagen de flota</span></div>'">
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- VENTAJAS -->
<section id="ventajas">
  <div class="section-header">
    <span class="section-label">Por qué alquilar</span>
    <h2 class="section-title">Ventajas del alquiler de barredoras</h2>
    <div class="separator"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="ventajas-grid">
    <div class="ventaja-card">
      <div class="ventaja-icon">
        <svg width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="#94A014" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2z"/><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"/></svg>
      </div>
      <h3>Sin inversión inicial</h3>
      <p>Accede a maquinaria de primera calidad sin comprometer capital. Solo pagas por el tiempo que necesitas.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="ventaja-card">
      <div class="ventaja-icon">
        <svg width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="#94A014" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
      </div>
      <h3>Equipos revisados y listos</h3>
      <p>Toda nuestra flota está en perfecto estado de mantenimiento. Recibes la máquina lista para trabajar desde el primer día.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="ventaja-card">
      <div class="ventaja-icon">
        <svg width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="#94A014" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M8 7V3M16 7V3M3 11h18M5 21h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z"/></svg>
      </div>
      <h3>Flexibilidad total</h3>
      <p>Alquila por días, semanas o periodos largos según la duración de tu proyecto. Nos adaptamos a tu planificación.</p>
    </div>
